flowchart LR
  user[User selects local MP3s] --> react[React UI: sequential batch, list, search]
  react -->|Same-origin HTTP| vite[Vite development proxy]
  vite -->|Native :5000 or Docker :8000| api
  subgraph backend[Backend process / Docker container]
    api[Flask routes + JSON validation]
    store[Exclusive unique upload storage]
    audio[MP3 decode, mono, 16 kHz]
    whisper[Local Whisper Tiny CPU inference]
    repo[SQLite repository]
    api -->|POST /transcribe| store
    store -->|Saved path; acquire inference lock| audio
    audio --> whisper
    whisper -->|Text; commit before 201 response| repo
    api -->|GET /transcriptions and /search| repo
    api -->|GET /health checks model and DB readiness| whisper
  end
  store --> uploads[(Retained MP3s: /data/uploads)]
  repo --> db[(SQLite: /data/transcriptions.sqlite3)]
  hf[Hugging Face: model assets only] -.->|Initial download / missing cache| cache[(Model cache: /models)]
  cache -.->|Startup load into process memory| whisper
  repo -->|JSON records via Flask + proxy| react
  style hf fill:#fff3d6,stroke:#b7791f
  style cache fill:#fff3d6,stroke:#b7791f
  %% Solid arrows: runtime work/data. Dashed arrows: model provisioning/startup.
  %% Data and model cache are separate named volumes in Compose.
  %% No recording is sent to Hugging Face for transcription.
